QuestGuidance.Register("en",360,{
[11489]="70041037\n1\tSpeak with the swan-knight guard outside the door\tThe swan-knight guard can be found outside of the Great Hall of the Prince. You should ask the swan-knight guard where suspicious folk are being investigated.\n2\tInvestigate the suspicious person in the Court of the Fount\tThe first suspicious character, possibly a Corsair in disguise, can be found somewhere around the Court of the Fount. You should investigate the first suspicious character.\n3\tInvestigate the suspicious person at the wharf\tThe second suspicious character, possibly a Corsair in disguise, can be found somewhere around the wharf of Dol Amroth. You should investigate the second suspicious character.\n4\tInvestigate the suspicious person at the warehouses\tThe third suspicious character, possibly a Corsair in disguise, can be found somewhere around the warehouses of Dol Amroth. You should investigate the third suspicious character.\n",
[11490]="700604B3\n1\tFind the suspicious camp-site\tLagordal has asked you to investigate a suspicious camp-site atop a cliff. The cliff can be found to the south-east, next to the waterfall opposite of Tornhad.\n2\tInvestigate camp-fire\030Investigate sack\tWhoever made this camp-site may have left something behind. You should search the camp-site for information.\n3\tInvestigate footprints\tYou have found a couple of signs of life at this camp-site. You should examine the footprints for more information.\n4\tTalk to Lagordal\tThe moment you tried to examine footprints at the camp-site, a Dunlending attacked you. You should return to Lagordal with this news.\n",
[11491]="700173A9\n1\tReturn the Brand to Ornras at Echad Mirobel\030Collect Angmar's Brand (quantity: see journal)\tA smith can be found in Mirobel, in the south-west region of Eregion. Ornras of Echad Mirobel has asked you to defeat enemies in that region and hopefully find one who bears Angmar's Brand. A great smith hidden among the lesser enemies would explain why powerful and fell ore is carried by some of the leaders of this northern host.\n",
[11492]="7002E535\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Hereswith\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[11493]="7002E524\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Hereswith\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
