[11495]="7002E52B\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Hereswith\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[11496]="70059771\n1\tDestroy barricades at Sutwarden\tBarricades can be found at Sutwarden in the Wildwood. You should destroy barricades at Sutwarden.\n2\tDestroy barricades at Sutwarden (total: 6)\tBarricades can be found at Sutwarden in the Wildwood. You should destroy barricades at Sutwarden.\n",
[11497]="7005978A\n1\tDefeat foes at Sutwarden\tFoes can be found at Sutwarden in the Wildwood. You should defeat foes at Sutwarden.\n2\tDefeat foes at Sutwarden (total: 6)\tFoes can be found at Sutwarden in the Wildwood. You should defeat foes at Sutwarden.\n",
[11498]="70008362\n1\tDefeat Ancient Ironscale\tThe rare Ancient Ironscale can sometimes be found amongst its lesser brethren in Malenhad. Othran has challenged you and your fellows to slay the dreaded Ancient Ironscale, lord of the fell turtles of Malenhad.\n2\tTalk to Othran\tOthran is at his camp in the western part of Malenhad. You should return to Othran to tell him the tale of your victory against the dreaded Ancient Ironscale.\n",
[11499]="70063CB5\n1\tDeliver the blunt branches to a collection box\030Collect blunt branches (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire blunt branches.\n",
