[11509]="7002FCA4\n1\tDestroy marsh-fly nests (total: 3)\tThe Stinging Bog is on the far side of the road from the Feldburg. You should destroy nests of the huge stinging marsh-flies in the Stinging Bog.\n2\tSpeak with Captain Agelmund about the nests\tCaptain Agelmund is at Feldburg in the Wold. You should speak with Captain Agelmund.\n",
[11510]="7006B6A5\n1\tDefeat scather-flies (total: 8)\tYou should slay some scather-flies in Umûn Khab to diminish their population. Umûn Khab is a marsh on the southern banks of the Ikorbân River.\n",
[11511]="700494BF\n1\tThorzhaf can be found in Talath Úrui. You should find a suitable place to help sway the current fighting match.\t\n2\tThorzhaf can be found in Talath Úrui. You should find a suitable place to help sway the current fighting match.\t\n3\tUse roar\tThorzhaf can be found in Talath Úrui. You should find a suitable place to help sway the current fighting match.\n4\tTalk to Párgrub\tPárgrub can be found near Thorzhaf. You should speak with Párgrub about the match.\n",
[11512]="70040001\n1\tCheck houses (total: 7)\tThe houses must be checked for corsairs.\n",
[11513]="70022928\n1\tCollect bilberries for Celandine's medicinal tea (total: 4)\tCelandine smelled bilberries by water to the east of Archet as she passed through last night. You should collect bilberries, for they make a sweet tea to stave off infection, or so the hobbits' lore will tell you.\n2\tBring the bilberries to Celandine\tCelandine Brandybuck awaits you in the centre of Archet. You should bring Celandine the bilberries you collected, for she intends to make a sweet medicinal tea to help strengthen Amdir's will.\n",
[11514]="7006C8A6\n1\tCollect honeycombs from beehives (total: 5)\tMeliri has tasked you with visiting each of the five beehives around the orange groves of Burukíri in Ambarûl, from which you are to collect honeycombs.\n2\tBring the honeycombs to Meliri\tYou have visited each of the five beehives around the orange groves of Burukíri in Ambarûl, from which you collected honeycombs. You bring them to Meliri.\n",
[11515]="70057EF5\n1\tTake Ciriel's pastries\tCiriel's plate of pastries are on the table next to her. You will need to take some pastries to distribute among the guards.\n2\tThere are hungry guards walking around nearby on the Third Circle. You should find them and deliver Ciriel's pastries.\t\n3\tSpeak with Ciriel\tCiriel expects your return on the Third Circle of Minas Tirith. You should relay the guards' messages of thanks to her.\n",
[11516]="7001938C\n1\tBring the water back to the Vineyards' cistern\tThe spring lies directly west of the Vineyards of Lórien. The Elves of Lothlórien draw water for their feasts from the clearest and sweetest spring in the forest. Glasnír has asked you to draw some water and return it to the cistern in front of the Vineyards.\n2\tTalk to Glasnír at the Vineyards of Lórien\tGlasnír is at the Vineyards of Lórien, east of the spring. You should speak with Glasnír regarding your task.\n",
[11517]="7002F999\n1\tDefeat Gat, the Orc brute\tGat and his Orc allies have been seen wandering the hills north and west of the mead hall. Enswith has described the Orc brute, Gat, and has encouraged you to defeat the Orc, in order to avenge her belated husband.\n2\tReturn to Enswith with news of Gat's defeat\tEnswith awaits at her farmstead, north-east of the meadhall of Faldham.\n",
[11518]="70028C93\n1\tDefeat Dunlendings within Brôntrig (total: 8)\tBrôntrig lies to the east of the tower where Answith is hiding. Answith asked you to stage a preemptive attack on Brôntrig.\n2\tDefeat Dunlending jailors (total: 3)\tThere are jailors among the prison-cages in Brôntrig. Answith asked you to dispose of the Dunlending jailors who are watching over the prisoners in Brôntrig.\n3\tTalk to Answith in the Isendale\tAnswith is encamped near the tower west of Brôntrig. You should return to Answith with news of your success.\n",
[11519]="7002EF26\n1\tSearch for Helvorlim, the heirloom sword of Béortnoth's family\tHelvorlim should be in a coffer or box somewhere in Thornhope. Thane Béortnoth has asked you to find Helvorlim, his family's heirloom sword.\n2\tBring Helvorlim to Thane Béortnoth\tThane Béortnoth is encamped outside of Thornhope. You should bring Helvorlim to Béortnoth at once.\n",
[11520]="7005AAAD\n1\tCollect weapons from Orc-spies (total: 7)\tOrc-spies near Stazg Vozag carry the weapons Klúso will need for the plan.\n2\tTalk to Klúso near Stazg Vozag\tKlúso is scouting near Stazg Vozag.\n",
